{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a.sector is a multiplayer, top-down space shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect loot, upgrade your ships, earn coins, play with friends! See if you can summon the boss or conquer some dark elite enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you maximize your ship's power by collecting enough floppy disks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 5 playable ship types: the fighter, the tank, the scout, the healer &amp; the juggernaut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends to gain a buff from their ship's aura!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aura buff effects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighter -&gt; boost your ship's attack power<br>Tank -&gt; boost your ship's damage reduction<br>Scout -&gt; boost your ship's movement speed<br>Healer -&gt; boost your ship's healing power<br>Juggernaut -&gt; boost your ship's max health</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002550?t=1762834651","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002550?t=1762834651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002550/bc2de04be65434f744a7501f9ad6658ab65bf70d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762834651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002550/bc2de04be65434f744a7501f9ad6658ab65bf70d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762834651","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a.sector is a multiplayer, top-down space shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect loot, upgrade your ships, earn coins, play wit